 Engineering and Knowledge Management","volume":"8876"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84914154525"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-ef13cd8a-84fe-4a2d-a3ff-991721493410"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Information flow within relational multi-context systems","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-641684","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
